audio: Win7 WASAPI fallback path (mix format + software conversion)

- when AUTOCONVERTPCM is rejected, open the stream with the exact GetMixFormat
- convert 16/24/32-bit int and 32/64-bit float, linear-interp resampling with fractional carry
- fix Initialize being called twice (AUDCLNT_E_ALREADY_INITIALIZED)
- add -force-audio-fallback / NETMUSIC_FORCE_FALLBACK so the fallback can be tested
- verified on both archs: 44.1k/16bit -> 48k/float32 plays with correct position
- docs: dual audio path + troubleshooting for no sound